<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Yhud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yhud</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yhud Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yhu.</para>
  <para style="mt">Yhud Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yhud wohso b́ guut'e boamanerawon amantsuwotsi araat kooti dano bád'iru ashuwotsatse krstiyaniwots bo tooko korbodek'etwok'o k'alosha. B́ gitsotse b́ detstso P'et'ros guut'ts gitlts arts b́ woshts k'awnanitse guut'tso «Aaniyi iwisherawok'on Ik'o bí ashuwotssh ikonoton b́ imts imnetiyats kup'de'err bo k'iretwok'owe» nababirwotssh kup'idek't mani b́ gawiyiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Kootetsi dano danifwots daniyo, bo doyonat bodih dihon 3-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Bo amantso korbodek'etwok'o izets izo 17-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Deero 24-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Iyesus Krstos guutso Yak'ob eshwi wottso Yuhudoke, S'eegetswotssh, Nihon Ik'on shuneetswotssh, Iyesus Krstosn kotets jametswotssh.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Maac' k'ewo, jeenonat shunon itsh ayowe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooti dano danifwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Shuneetswotso! Ik wotdek'at nokashts kashi jango itsh guut'o ayidek'at geeyatniye tteshi, andmo aaniy iwisho b́ geyrawook'on Ik'o bí ashuwotssh iknoton b́ imts imnetiyi jangosh kup'de'er it kaaritwok'o itsh guut'o ayidek't geyiko taash b́woti. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Boats angshetwok'o ay duroniyere shino bojangosh guut'etswots mut'at itits kindrnee, bohe Izar Izewerko s'aato gusiyi beyon wonitwots Ik'o Ik'irawwotsiye, no doonz b́ s'uzi wottso Iyesus Krstosnor haalitune.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Jaman shin shino iknoton it dankawotiyalor doonzo Gbs' datsatse kisht b́ kashitsok'oonat amanerawwotsnowere il b́ t'afitsok'o itsh gawiyo, shunfee. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Boon naashiyetsatse beshat bobeyoko fakshk'rts melakiwotsi aab s'iilere, Ik'o boon angshi eeno aawotssh b́borfetso dúre dúri tipoon, nic' etts t'aluwots kotdek't beezree. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Aze. 19:1-24</ref></char></note> Mank'oon Sedom, Gemoornat bo gúúratsi kitwotswere gusiyetswotsi bowoti, niwalonowere gobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gobo: </char><char style="ft">Grik mas'afatse k'osh atsonton (meetsonton) bo gonkeyi etfe. </char></note> boami. Mansh bo dúre dúri taawon sezeyirwotsi ariyetswotsi woternee.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Mank'owere ashaanots bo gúmon jisheyat bomeetso bokimshiri, naashwotsshoor aleraknee, darotse mang detstswotsnowere boc'ashiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan. 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Bek'. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Iwi. 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zek. 3:2</ref></char></note> Melakiwotsitsi naasho Mika'elwor dab Muse duuni jangosh Diyablosnton b́ mooshor «Ik'o neen fayowe» eta b́ eti bako c'asho c'ayatse. <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Ashaanotsmó t'iwitsdek'oosh bo falaaw keew jamo boc'ashiri, gaw dek'falaw dini s'otswotskok'o bo azeewon bodants keewo fa'e wotiyalor dab bíne bot'afiti. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Aze. 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Taaw. 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16:1-35</ref></char></note> K'aayen werindon boamtsotse, gizosha ett Bele'ami dáriits weeron bo dihitsotse, K'oree Ik'o b́ k'eftsok'o boowere k'efat bo t'aftsosh indowe boosha! <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Ashaanots bo jitserawo gusiyon ikwotar moonat úshoke bodatsewor itsh t'uge bowotititi, bo boshiyaniriye botookk mec'eroshee, jongon gifiniyeyiru, awsh deshaw dawnok'one, shuu daatseef shashotse dab shuu biyatse daatseraw, b́ s'ap'ootse wat'ere gitoto shuuk'ts mitok'one. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Bo, fayiru aats k'ari fuundok'o boon jitsits fini úmbo kishirune, nyic' etts t'aluwo dúre dúrosh boon b́ kotirwotsnat hake bako jawriru k'eenwotskok'one.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:18">Aze. 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref> </char>
    </note> Adamatse tuut shawatl gubratse shuwetso Henok bek'on b́keewor hank'o etre, «Eshe doonzo ay tats kum b́ wosh nana'a S'ayinwotsnton wotde jametsats angshosh weetwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>Doonzo bín Ik'iraw ashmanots bofints gond keewatse tuutson sezitwe, Arikon doonzo bín Ik'iraw morrets hanotsi bíyats bokeewts gond keew jamwotsatse tuutson bo atsats angshitwe.»<verse eid="JUD 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Ashaanots jam aawo mumudefetst ik keewonor genee'úweraknee, botook gond tewni jafrats sha'irwotsiye, bonono míshi keewon s'eenke, botook keewo geeyat asho weeralo bo dáshiri.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boatso korbodek'etwok'o izets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Shuneetswotso! Itiyere! Nodoonź Iyesus Krstos woshetswots haniyere shin bokeewts keewo gawde'ere. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 P'et'. 3:3</ref> </char></note> Bo «Dúri s'uwatse Ik'i hasabiyatse wokat bo took gond tewno shuuts sha'iru c'aashetswots weetune» itsh etrne boteshi. <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Boye ash dago gaakirwotsiye, meetsi tewni jafrats sha'irwotsiye, S'ayin shayronowere deshawotsiye. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>T mashotso! jamoniyere bogo s'ayin wotts it imnetiyon it tooko agosh kup'ore, S'ayin shayiri angonowere Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Nodoonz Iyesus Krstoswor b́mac' nefon dúre dúri kasho itsh b́ betsitwok'o korde'er it tooko Ik'i shunoots korde'ere.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Git nibetsdetswotssh ashuwotssh maac'o k'ewore, <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Ik ikwotsi taawotse kishde'er kashiwere, k'oshwotssh shatoon maac'o k'ewore, b́woteferor morron kiimts bo atso t'awits tahman b́ oorerawo shid'ere.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Udon Ik' k'ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>It dihrawok'o woshitwonat eeg eeg deshawwotsi woshr geneúwon b́mangi shinats t'intsosh falitwosh, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>B́ s'uz noosh no ato wottso Izar Izewersh, nodoonz Iyesus Krstos weeron shintson tuur, dúre dúrosh mangonat, baatson, kup'oonat alonwere wotowe! amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
